{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012w7BLMcoQd5Who5mdeewhQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Dual Bottleneck 框架方向正确但 Eff-K 作为定量预测器有噪声，需弱化为 \"necessary condition\n2\t  that interacts with SC\"。 K/T sensitivity curves 呈大致 inverted-U / peak-at-0.7 但各有\n3\t  1-2 个 non-monotonic outlier， 用 error bar / CI overlay 展示 noise level，frame 为 \"directionally\n4\t  consistent despite noise\"。 论文重心从 Condorcet 理论预测力转向 oracle gap (+14.22pp, p=2e-7)\n5\t  + 9 remediation failures (breadth argument)。 Condorcet 框架降为 \"explanatory lens\" 而非\n6\t  \"predictive framework\"。 Seed variance 明确表述为 \"Eff-K explains cross-model variance;\n7\t  within-model variance remains dominated by stochastic factors\"。 exp-050b ICL complication\n8\t  放 discussion 作为 limitation / future work。 投稿目标 Findings (≥3.0)；如 breadth of analysis\n9\t  获审稿人认可可能升 Main (≤3.2)。\n10\t\n11\t  '\n12\timagined_experiments:\n13\t- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n14\t  plan_id: exp-002\n15\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B K sensitivity (K=6,8,11,12,16,20) on D012 60 questions\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    n: 60\n18\t    K6_sica: 0.733\n19\t    K6_sc: 0.733\n20\t    K6_delta_pp: 0.0\n21\t    K8_sica: 0.717\n22\t    K8_sc: 0.75\n23\t    K8_delta_pp: -3.3\n24\t    K11_sica: 0.733\n25\t    K11_sc: 0.733\n26\t    K11_delta_pp: 0.0\n27\t    K12_sica: 0.717\n28\t    K12_sc: 0.75\n29\t    K12_delta_pp: -3.3\n30\t    K16_sica: 0.7\n31\t    K16_sc: 0.733\n32\t    K16_delta_pp: -3.3\n33\t    K20_sica: 0.7\n34\t    K20_sc: 0.717\n35\t    K20_delta_pp: -1.7\n36\t    all_K_sica_leq_sc: true\n37\t    kappa_14b_estimated: 0.76\n38\t    eff_k_range: 1.25–1.32\n39\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B Fleiss'' κ≈0.76，Eff-K 仅 1.25–1.32，trace 间几乎完全相关。 增加\n40\t    K 只叠加冗余 trace 而不增加独立信息。Qwen SC 基线 ~75% 处于 Type A regime (confirmation bias)，约束方向镜像模型偏差。因此所有\n41\t    K 值 SICA ≤ SC。 K=11 (odd) 消除 exact-tie 场景，gap=0 确认 Qwen 上 SICA 无 tiebreak 之外的获益机制。\n42\t    Larger K 时 SICA 略劣，因更多约束放大了 confirmation bias。\n43\t\n44\t    '\n45\t  tables:\n46\t  - T5\n47\t  figures_description:\n48\t  - F3 中 Qwen 对照线 (flat/declining)，与 Mistral inverted-U 形成对比\n49\t  analysis: 'Qwen 全 K 值 SICA≤SC 是 Eff-K 理论的 negative control。K=11 gap=0 额外确认 SICA\n50\t    对 Qwen 无非 tiebreak 价值。与 exp-051 (Mistral inverted-U) 对比是 T5 的核心叙事。\n51\t\n52\t    '\n53\t- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n54\t  plan_id: exp-003\n55\t  description: SICA vs SC-random/deterministic tiebreak，CPU-only 重分析\n56\t  expected_results:\n57\t    n_tiebreak_cases: 5\n58\t    sica_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.8\n59\t    random_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.5\n60\t    alphabetical_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.6\n61\t    first_seen_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.4\n62\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B D012 中仅 ~5 个 tied cases (C0=53% 但多数 multi-candidate\n63\t    问题 SC 有明确多数)。 SICA 4/5 选对 (80%) 优于 random (50%)，但 n 太小无统计显著性。 说明 SICA tiebreak\n64\t    机制本身有效，但 Qwen 上 tied 场景太少，整体增益被稀释到 ~0pp。\n65\t\n66\t    '\n67\t  tables:\n68\t  - T1 footnote\n69\t  figures_description: []\n70\t  analysis: 'Tiebreak 是 SICA 唯一有效的子机制。Qwen 高 κ 条件下约束无法在 non-tied cases 中翻转 SC， 限制了总体影响。回应\n71\t    reviewer concern #13 (random tiebreak baseline)。\n72\t\n73\t    '\n74\t- name: sica_7b_scaling\n75\t  plan_id: exp-004\n76\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60 questions (K=12, T=0.7)\n77\t  expected_results:\n78\t    n: 60\n79\t    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n80\t    sc_accuracy: 0.683\n81\t    delta_pp: 0.0\n82\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.433\n83\t    extraction_rate: 0.942\n84\t    mcnemar_p: 1.0\n85\t    kappa_estimated: 0.68\n86\t    eff_k_estimated: 1.42\n87\t    folio_sica: 0.767\n88\t    folio_sc: 0.733\n89\t    proofwriter_sica: 0.6\n90\t    proofwriter_sc: 0.633\n91\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-7B 比 14B 弱但同家族，κ 仍高 (~0.68)，Eff-K~1.42。C0 比 14B 高 (43% vs\n92\t    38%) 但 constraint quality 同样受 Qwen 系 confirmation bias 影响。SC 基线 ~68% 处于 Type A\n93\t    边缘。Delta=0 因为 FOLIO 微正 (+3.3pp) 被 PW 微负 (-3.3pp) 抵消。 Qwen 家族内 scaling 不改变 SICA\n94\t    效果方向。\n95\t\n96\t    '\n97\t  tables:\n98\t  - T1\n99\t  - T3\n100\t  figures_description:\n101\t  - 'F2 scatter: Qwen-7B (SC≈68%, Δ=0)'\n102\t  analysis: 'Qwen-7B 进一步确认 Qwen 家族的 independence bottleneck。即使 SC 降到 68% (更接近 Goldilocks)，trace\n103\t    κ 仍高到 SICA 无法获益。支持 \"Eff-K 是跨模型必要条件\"。\n104\t\n105\t    '\n106\t- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n107\t  plan_id: exp-005\n108\t  description: QwQ-32B 已有数据汇总为 negative control\n109\t  expected_results:\n110\t    total_problems: 46\n111\t    qwq_aggregate_c0_effective_pct: 2.6\n112\t    aime_c0: 0.0\n113\t    proofwriter_c0: 18.75\n114\t    folio_c0: 0.0\n115\t    aime_delta_pp: 0.0\n116\t    proofwriter_delta_pp: -5.9\n117\t    kappa_estimated: 0.92\n118\t    eff_k_estimated: 1.08\n119\t  result_rationale: 'QwQ-32B 作为 reasoning model，内置 CoT 极度 deterministic。即使 T=0.7，reasoning\n120\t    chain 使 trace 间 κ→0.92，Eff-K→1.08 (几乎退化为单次采样)。C0 有效率仅 2.6%，SICA≡SC。 这是 Eff-K 框架最极端的验证：Eff-K≈1\n121\t    时任何聚合方法都无法超越 single sample。\n122\t\n123\t    '\n124\t  tables:\n125\t  - T1\n126\t  - T3\n127\t  figures_description:\n128\t  - 'F2 scatter 最右上角: QwQ-32B (SC high, Δ=0)'\n129\t  analysis: 'QwQ-32B 是 degenerate case。完美回应 reviewer concern #12 \"为什么不用 reasoning\n130\t    model\"。 Reasoning model trace 更 deterministic → C0→0 → SICA 退化。放 Appendix 详述。\n131\t\n132\t    '\n133\t- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n134\t  plan_id: exp-006\n135\t  description: C0 vs SICA-SC gap 跨所有 model×dataset 条件的 scatter 分析\n136\t  expected_results:\n137\t    n_conditions: 12\n138\t    c0_delta_pearson_r: 0.45\n139\t    c0_delta_pearson_p: 0.14\n140\t    c0_below_20_conditions: 4\n141\t    c0_below_20_all_delta_leq_0: true\n142\t    c0_above_20_positive_delta_rate: 0.5\n143\t    outlier_conditions: 2\n144\t    c0_necessary_not_sufficient: true\n145\t  result_rationale: 'C0<20% 的 4 个条件 (QwQ-32B, ARC-14B, GSM8K-14B, Qwen-72B) 全部 delta≤0，\n146\t    C0 作为必要条件方向正确。但 C0>20% 不保证正 delta：LLaMA FOLIO-204 C0=62% delta=-2.5pp， Mistral\n147\t    PW600 C0=50% delta=-2.8pp。r=0.45 方向正确但 p=0.14 不显著 (12 个点太少)。 C0 只捕捉 diversity\n148\t    维度，不反映 constraint quality，因此不够做 \"predictor\"。\n149\t\n150\t    '\n151\t  tables:\n152\t  - T1 summary\n153\t  figures_description:\n154\t  - 'F2 hero figure: C0 (x) vs Δpp (y) scatter，C0=20% 虚线 threshold'\n155\t  analysis: 'C0 零成本部署诊断的价值在于 negative predictive power：C0<20% → 不要部署 SICA。 Positive\n156\t    prediction 需结合 SC level 和 Eff-K。这是 median tier \"necessary condition\" 叙事的定量支撑，也是\n157\t    Claim 4 (C0+SC diagnostic) 的核心证据。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t- name: sica_72b_awq\n161\t  plan_id: exp-007\n162\t  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on D012 60 questions\n163\t  expected_results:\n164\t    n: 60\n165\t    sica_accuracy: 0.833\n166\t    sc_accuracy: 0.85\n167\t    delta_pp: -1.7\n168\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.15\n169\t    extraction_rate: 0.95\n170\t    kappa_estimated: 0.82\n171\t    eff_k_estimated: 1.2\n172\t    mcnemar_p: 1.0\n173\t  result_rationale: '72B 是 Qwen 家族最强模型，SC 基线 ~85%，C0 仅 15%。κ≈0.82，Eff-K≈1.20。 完全处于\n174\t    Type A regime：trace 高度一致 → 约束全部 confirm 多数答案 → SICA=SC 或略劣。 delta=-1.7pp 因为个别\n175\t    case 中 SICA 约束排除了原本正确的少数答案。 形成 Qwen 内 7B/14B/72B scaling curve：越强 → C0 越低 → SICA\n176\t    越无效到有害。\n177\t\n178\t    '\n179\t  tables:\n180\t  - T1\n181\t  figures_description:\n182\t  - 'F2 scatter: Qwen-72B (SC≈85%, Δ≈-1.7)'\n183\t  analysis: '72B 完善 Qwen 家族 scaling 分析：7B(SC=68%,Δ=0) → 14B(SC=75%,Δ=+0.3) → 72B(SC=85%,Δ=-1.7)。\n184\t    Model size↑ → SC↑ C0↓ Eff-K↓。完美支持 Type A regime 理论。回应 reviewer concern #5 模型覆盖。\n185\t\n186\t    '\n187\t- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n188\t  plan_id: exp-008\n189\t  description: 5-10 道代表性问题的约束质量定性分析\n190\t  expected_results:\n191\t    n_cases: 8\n192\t    trivially_satisfied_pct: 43\n193\t    semantically_meaningful_pct: 35\n194\t    confirmation_bias_aligned_pct: 55\n195\t    extraction_error_pct: 12\n196\t    cases_constraint_flips_correct: 2\n197\t    cases_constraint_flips_wrong: 1\n198\t  result_rationale: '定性分析揭示三种典型约束模式：(1) 43% trivially satisfied — 被所有候选答案满足； (2) 35%\n199\t    semantically meaningful 但方向与模型多数答案一致 (confirmation bias)； (3) 12% 提取错误 (语法错误、变量名不一致)。净效果：~92%\n200\t    约束 ARE discriminative (exp-023) 但 discrimination 方向与模型偏差对齐。2/8 cases 翻转正确，1/8\n201\t    翻转错误。\n202\t\n203\t    '\n204\t  tables:\n205\t  - T4\n206\t  figures_description:\n207\t  - 'F4 stacked bar: constraint quality breakdown by category'\n208\t  analysis: 'Case studies 为 T4 taxonomy 提供具体例子。关键 insight：问题不在约束缺乏判别力， 而在 discriminative\n209\t    约束的区分方向与模型偏差一致。是 confirmation bias 的 mechanism-level 证据。\n210\t\n211\t    '\n212\t- name: overhead_analysis\n213\t  plan_id: exp-009\n214\t  description: SICA pipeline wall-time 分解 (n=804)\n215\t  expected_results:\n216\t    n: 804\n217\t    mean_total_wall_s: 61.6\n218\t    trace_gen_pct: 51.3\n219\t    extract_pct: 47.0\n220\t    dedup_pct: 1.6\n221\t    maxsat_pct: 0.005\n222\t    sica_overhead_pct: 48.7\n223\t    p90_overhead_pct: 57.6\n224\t  result_rationale: 'SICA 额外开销几乎全部来自 constraint extraction (LLM 二次调用 ~47%)，MaxSAT\n225\t    求解极快 (<0.01%)。 总成本约 SC 的 2 倍。在 median tier 下 SICA 增益 ≤+5pp 且仅在特定条件下有效， 但成本翻倍。Paper\n226\t    应 frame 为 analysis tool 而非 practical improvement。\n227\t\n228\t    '\n229\t  tables:\n230\t  - Appendix overhead table\n231\t  figures_description: []\n232\t  analysis: '48.7% overhead 全来自 extraction。如果 extraction 可做更好 (oracle gap +14pp 显示上限)，\n233\t    overhead 合理。但当前 self-extraction 质量使 overhead 不值。支持 pure analysis framing。\n234\t\n235\t    '\n236\t- name: sica_llama_8b\n237\t  plan_id: exp-011\n238\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions (K=12, T=0.7)\n239\t  expected_results:\n240\t    n: 60\n241\t    sica_accuracy: 0.667\n242\t    sc_accuracy: 0.6\n243\t    delta_pp: 6.67\n244\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.617\n245\t    extraction_rate: 0.856\n246\t    mcnemar_p: 0.219\n247\t    kappa_estimated: 0.38\n248\t    eff_k_estimated: 2.35\n249\t    folio_delta_pp: 10.0\n250\t    proofwriter_delta_pp: 3.33\n251\t    truncated_traces: 44\n252\t  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B SC 基线 ~60%，C0 高达 62%，处于 Goldilocks zone 边缘。κ≈0.38，Eff-K≈2.35，\n253\t    trace 间独立性明显高于 Qwen。+6.67pp 是 D012 上最大 raw delta，但 n=60 致 p=0.22 不显著。 FOLIO 子集\n254\t    +10pp 突出。但 exp-020 (LLaMA FOLIO-204 delta=-2.45pp) 警告这可能是 small-n artifact。 在\n255\t    median tier 中是 \"suggestive but unreplicated\"。\n256\t\n257\t    '\n258\t  tables:\n259\t  - T1\n260\t  - T3\n261\t  figures_description:\n262\t  - 'F2 scatter: LLaMA-8B D012 (SC≈60%, Δ=+6.7, n.s.) 高亮但标注 n=60'\n263\t  analysis: 'LLaMA-8B 支持 \"moderate Eff-K can enable gains\" 但 exp-020 的反转 (-2.45pp)\n264\t    限制了 claim 强度。 在 paper 中作为 directional evidence，不能做 confirmation。\n265\t\n266\t    '\n267\t- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n268\t  plan_id: exp-012\n269\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot (K=12)\n270\t  expected_results:\n271\t    n: 30\n272\t    sica_accuracy: 0.967\n273\t    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n274\t    delta_pp: 0.0\n275\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.133\n276\t    extraction_success_rate: 0.147\n277\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B GSM8K SC~97%，几乎全对。C0 仅 13%。更关键的是 extraction rate 仅 15%\n278\t    — 数学域 constraint extraction 困难得多 (开放答案空间，数值计算而非逻辑推理)。 GSM8K 是 Type A 极端 + Type\n279\t    B 部分：SC 太高 AND domain formalization 困难。\n280\t\n281\t    '\n282\t  tables:\n283\t  - T1\n284\t  figures_description:\n285\t  - 'F2 scatter: GSM8K (SC≈97%, Δ=0)'\n286\t  analysis: 'GSM8K 贡献两个 insight：(1) 数学域 extraction 本身困难，C0 不适用； (2) 简单 math 上 SC 太高无论如何\n287\t    SICA 无效。支持 Type B (domain formalizability)。\n288\t\n289\t    '\n290\t- name: constraint_ablation\n291\t  plan_id: exp-013\n292\t  description: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight 消融 (n=804)\n293\t  expected_results:\n294\t    maxsat_accuracy: 0.765\n295\t    count_only_accuracy: 0.766\n296\t    random_weight_accuracy: 0.759\n297\t    sc_baseline: 0.762\n298\t    agreement_maxsat_vs_countonly: 803/804\n299\t    mcnemar_all_nonsignificant: true\n300\t  result_rationale: 'MaxSAT 与 count-only agreement 达 803/804 (99.9%)。MaxSAT 的 satisfiability\n301\t    weighting 在当前约束质量下无额外贡献 — 简单计数就能达到相同效果。根因：约束间高度冗余 (同 trace 提取 的约束倾向同方向)，MaxSAT\n302\t    组合优化退化为简单计数。是 independence bottleneck 的 mechanism-level 证据。\n303\t\n304\t    '\n305\t  tables:\n306\t  - T1 footnote / Appendix\n307\t  figures_description: []\n308\t  analysis: 'MaxSAT=count-only 是 capability trap 核心机制证据。若约束独立，MaxSAT 应发现组合 patterns。\n309\t    约束高冗余使求解器退化。对比 exp-031 oracle (+14pp) 证明 solver 本身没问题，是输入约束质量限制。\n310\t\n311\t    '\n312\t- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n313\t  plan_id: exp-014\n314\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on D012 60 questions\n315\t  expected_results:\n316\t    n: 60\n317\t    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n318\t    sc_accuracy: 0.717\n319\t    delta_pp: -3.33\n320\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.583\n321\t    extraction_rate: 0.839\n322\t    truncated_traces: 72\n323\t    mcnemar_p: 0.48\n324\t    kappa_estimated: 0.52\n325\t    eff_k_estimated: 1.78\n326\t  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek-R1 蒸馏版 trace 带 extended thinking，C0=58% (vs QwQ 2.6%)\n327\t    但 72/720 traces 被 truncated (max_tokens 限制)。Truncation 破坏 constraint extraction\n328\t    质量导致 delta=-3.33pp。 Eff-K 理论预测方向正确 (moderate Eff-K≈1.78 应有正向潜力) 但 truncation confound\n329\t    使预测失效。 这是 median tier \"noise point\" 之一。\n330\t\n331\t    '\n332\t  tables:\n333\t  - T1\n334\t  - T3\n335\t  figures_description:\n336\t  - 'F2 scatter: DeepSeek-R1 标注 ''truncation confound'''\n337\t  analysis: 'DeepSeek-R1 的 negative delta 由 truncation artifact 驱动，非 independence\n338\t    bottleneck 反例。 Paper 中作为 caveat 处理。占 Eff-K 预测失败的 12 条件中的 1 个。\n339\t\n340\t    '\n341\t- name: logic_lm_baseline\n342\t  plan_id: exp-015\n343\t  description: Logic-LM × K + majority vote baseline on FOLIO\n344\t  expected_results:\n345\t    n: 204\n346\t    logic_lm_k12_accuracy: 0.74\n347\t    sc_k12_accuracy: 0.755\n348\t    sica_k12_accuracy: 0.745\n349\t    logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp: -1.5\n350\t    logic_lm_single_trace_accuracy: 0.72\n351\t    fol_parse_rate: 0.82\n352\t  result_rationale: 'Logic-LM 对每条 trace 独立做 FOL extraction + Z3 verification 然后 majority\n353\t    vote。 在 Qwen-14B 高 κ 条件下，Logic-LM ≈ SC 因为每条 trace 的 FOL verification 大多验证了 trace\n354\t    自身的答案 (self-consistency within trace)。FOL parse rate ~82% 限制了有效 trace 数量。 Logic-LM\n355\t    略劣于 SC 因为 parse failure 的 trace 被丢弃降低了 vote pool。\n356\t\n357\t    '\n358\t  tables:\n359\t  - Appendix baseline comparison\n360\t  figures_description: []\n361\t  analysis: 'Logic-LM 证明 FOL extraction 本身不是 SICA 的 value add —— 差异在于跨 trace aggregation\n362\t    (MaxSAT)。 但 MaxSAT=count-only (exp-013)，所以 SICA 唯一贡献是 tiebreak。加强 capability trap\n363\t    论证。\n364\t\n365\t    '\n366\t- name: weighted_sc_baseline\n367\t  plan_id: exp-016\n368\t  description: Weighted SC baseline (uniform/length/inv-length/constraint-count) on\n369\t    804 questions\n370\t  expected_results:\n371\t    sc_uniform: 0.762\n372\t    inv_length_weighted: 0.767\n373\t    length_weighted: 0.753\n374\t    constraint_count_weighted: 0.753\n375\t    sica: 0.765\n376\t    inv_length_vs_sc_p: 0.453\n377\t    all_nonsignificant: true\n378\t  result_rationale: '所有 weighting scheme 与 SC 无显著差异。Inv-length (+0.5pp) 略正 — 更短 trace\n379\t    更可能是 confident 回答。但效果太小属随机波动。关键 takeaway：simple weighting 无法替代 independence —\n380\t    问题不在 vote quality 而在 vote independence。Correlated votes 怎么 weight 仍然 correlated。\n381\t\n382\t    '\n383\t  tables:\n384\t  - Appendix baseline comparison\n385\t  figures_description: []\n386\t  analysis: '回应 reviewer concern #15。所有 weighting 全 n.s.，证明 independence bottleneck\n387\t    是根本性的， 不能通过 simpler weighting 解决。\n388\t\n389\t    '\n390\t- name: sica_strategyqa_14b\n391\t  plan_id: exp-017\n392\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60 questions (K=12)\n393\t  expected_results:\n394\t    n: 60\n395\t    sica_accuracy: 0.567\n396\t    sc_accuracy: 0.533\n397\t    delta_pp: 3.33\n398\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n399\t    extraction_rate_trace: 0.704\n400\t    bootstrap_p: 0.135\n401\t    contradiction_detected: 5\n402\t    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n403\t    discordant_sc_wins: 0\n404\t  result_rationale: 'StrategyQA binary (Yes/No)，Qwen-14B SC~53% (接近随机)。C0 仅 10% 因为\n405\t    binary format 只有 2 个候选，SC 容易 unanimous。Extraction rate 仅 70% (commonsense 难形式化为\n406\t    FOL)。 +3.33pp 正向但 n.s. (仅 2 个 discordant cases)。Type B partial case：domain 部分可形式化\n407\t    但约束质量低且 C0 低。\n408\t\n409\t    '\n410\t  tables:\n411\t  - T1\n412\t  figures_description:\n413\t  - 'F2 scatter: StrategyQA (SC≈53%, Δ=+3.3, n.s.)'\n414\t  analysis: 'StrategyQA 低 C0 (10%) 说明 binary format 限制了 SICA 应用空间。即使 SC 在 Goldilocks\n415\t    zone， answer space 太小导致 SC 容易 unanimous。支持 \"C0+SC two-dimensional diagnostic\"。\n416\t\n417\t    '\n418\t- name: sica_arc_challenge_14b\n419\t  plan_id: exp-018\n420\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60 questions (K=12)\n421\t  expected_results:\n422\t    n: 60\n423\t    sica_accuracy: 0.95\n424\t    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n425\t    delta_pp: -1.67\n426\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.05\n427\t    extraction_rate: 1.0\n428\t    contradiction_detected: 3\n429\t    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n430\t    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n431\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B ARC-Challenge SC=96.7%，极高基线。C0 仅 5% — 虽是 4-choice format\n432\t    (理论上 C0 应更高) 但 14B 太强，高度确信一个选项。delta=-1.67pp 因仅有的 3 个 multi-candidate 问题中 SICA\n433\t    1 个选错。 Type A extreme：模型太强 → C0→0 → SICA 退化。\n434\t\n435\t    '\n436\t  tables:\n437\t  - T1\n438\t  figures_description:\n439\t  - 'F2 scatter: ARC (SC≈97%, Δ=-1.7)'\n440\t  analysis: 'ARC 的 4-choice format 理论上给 SICA 更多空间，但实际 C0 极低。 说明 C0 主要由模型能力决定而非答案格式。Type\n441\t    A 极端案例。\n442\t\n443\t    '\n444\t- name: constraint_quality_correlation\n445\t  plan_id: exp-019\n446\t  description: Constraint precision × C0 × SICA-SC gap 跨域跨模型相关分析\n447\t  expected_results:\n448\t    n_conditions: 12\n449\t    constraint_precision_mean: 0.62\n450\t    constraint_precision_range:\n451\t    - 0.45\n452\t    - 0.82\n453\t    c0_quality_correlation_r: -0.35\n454\t    c0_quality_correlation_p: 0.26\n455\t    quality_delta_correlation_r: 0.28\n456\t    quality_delta_correlation_p: 0.38\n457\t    effk_sc_joint_prediction_correct: 8\n458\t    effk_sc_joint_prediction_total: 12\n459\t    false_positive_conditions:\n460\t    - LLaMA-8B D012 (Eff-K=2.35, SC=60% → predicted positive, actual n.s.)\n461\t    - StrategyQA-14B (SC=53% in zone but C0=10% → no room)\n462\t    false_negative_conditions:\n463\t    - DeepSeek-R1 (truncation confound)\n464\t    - exp-050b ICL (trace generation characteristic change)\n465\t  result_rationale: '高 SC 条件 (Qwen-14B/72B): quality~0.75-0.82, C0 低 → delta=0。 中\n466\t    SC 条件 (Mistral FOLIO): quality~0.60-0.65, C0 中等 → delta variable。 低 SC 条件 (Mistral\n467\t    PW600): quality~0.45-0.50, C0 高 → delta negative。 C0-quality 反相关 r=-0.35 方向正确但\n468\t    p=0.26 (12 点太少+seed variance)。 Eff-K+SC 联合预测 8/12 方向正确：2 false positive (LLaMA\n469\t    D012, StrategyQA)， 2 edge case (DeepSeek truncation, exp-050b ICL)。8/12 支持 \"necessary\n470\t    condition\" 但不够强做 \"predictor\"。\n471\t\n472\t    '\n473\t  tables:\n474\t  - T3 extended\n475\t  - T4\n476\t  figures_description:\n477\t  - 'F2 hero: SC vs Δ scatter with Eff-K color coding and constraint quality annotations'\n478\t  analysis: '8/12 方向正确是 median tier 最关键的 qualification。Paper 核心表述： \"Eff-K explains\n479\t    cross-model variance; within-model variance remains dominated by stochastic factors.\"\n480\t    F2 用 Eff-K color coding 展示跨模型 pattern + error bar 展示 within-seed noise。\n481\t\n482\t    '\n483\t- name: mistral_k_sensitivity\n484\t  plan_id: exp-051\n485\t  description: Mistral-7B K sensitivity (K=4,8,12,16,20) on FOLIO 204, seed=42\n486\t  expected_results:\n487\t    n: 204\n488\t    K4_sc_pct: 55.4\n489\t    K4_sica_pct: 54.9\n490\t    K4_delta_pp: -0.5\n491\t    K4_eff_k: 1.6\n492\t    K4_mcnemar_p: 0.85\n493\t    K8_sc_pct: 54.9\n494\t    K8_sica_pct: 59.3\n495\t    K8_delta_pp: 4.4\n496\t    K8_eff_k: 1.78\n497\t    K8_mcnemar_p: 0.03\n498\t    K12_sc_pct: 54.4\n499\t    K12_sica_pct: 58.3\n500\t    K12_delta_pp: 3.9\n501\t    K12_eff_k: 1.85\n502\t    K12_mcnemar_p: 0.022\n503\t    K16_sc_pct: 54.4\n504\t    K16_sica_pct: 55.9\n505\t    K16_delta_pp: 1.5\n506\t    K16_eff_k: 1.88\n507\t    K16_mcnemar_p: 0.38\n508\t    K20_sc_pct: 53.9\n509\t    K20_sica_pct: 55.9\n510\t    K20_delta_pp: 2.0\n511\t    K20_eff_k: 1.9\n512\t    K20_mcnemar_p: 0.3\n513\t    peak_K: 8\n514\t    non_monotonic_points:\n515\t    - K=8 高于 K=12\n516\t    - K=20 略高于 K=16\n517\t    inverted_u_visual: 大致 inverted-U 但 K=8 是实际最高点 (+4.4pp)，K=20 相对 K=16 有微弱反弹\n518\t  result_rationale: \"Mistral FOLIO seed42 是唯一有正向 SICA 效果的核心条件。K sensitivity 预期大致 inverted-U：\\\n519\t    \\ — K=4 (Eff-K=1.60): trace 太少，约束不足以可靠 discriminate，delta≈0。 — K=8 (Eff-K=1.78):\\\n520\t    \\ 甜区 — 足够多约束但冗余尚低。约束间 overlap 比 K=12 更低，\\n  产生 non-monotonic 高点 +4.4pp。这是核心 outlier。\\n\\\n521\t    — K=12 (Eff-K=1.85): delta=+3.9pp，与 exp-033 的 +4.9pp 接近但略低 (K ablation 用\\n  K=20\\\n522\t    \\ traces 的 subset，与 exp-033 独立生成的 K=12 traces 有差异)。\\n— K=16 (Eff-K=1.88): 冗余约束增加，confirmation\\\n523\t    \\ bias dominate，delta 下降到 +1.5pp。 — K=20 (Eff-K=1.90): 微弱反弹 +2.0pp — 第二个 non-monotonic\\\n524\t    \\ 点。可能因 K=20 采样到\\n  更多 minority traces 偶然包含有用 diverse constraint。\\nK=8 > K=12\\\n525\t    \\ 是 median tier 的核心 outlier。Paper 应用 CI overlay + error bar 处理。\\n\"\n526\t  tables:\n527\t  - T5\n528\t  figures_description:\n529\t  - 'F3 主图: K vs Δpp 折线 (Mistral inverted-U with CI bands + Qwen flat 对照)，K vs Eff-K\n530\t    次轴'\n531\t  analysis: 'K sensitivity inverted-U 部分验证 Eff-K 框架：K↑ → Eff-K↑ (diminishing returns)\n532\t    → delta 先升后降。 但 K=8 > K=12 的 non-monotonicity 说明 Eff-K 不是唯一因素。 Paper frame: \"directionally\n533\t    consistent despite noise; peak at K=8-12 supports moderate K recommendation.\"\n534\t    与 Qwen flat line 对比是 T5/F3 核心叙事。\n535\t\n536\t    '\n537\t- name: multitemp_mistral_folio\n538\t  plan_id: exp-055\n539\t  description: Multi-temperature ensemble (T=0.3/0.5/0.7/1.0 × 3 traces each = K=12)\n540\t    Mistral FOLIO 204\n541\t  expected_results:\n542\t    n: 204\n543\t    sc_accuracy_pct: 54.4\n544\t    sica_multitemp_pct: 53.9\n545\t    delta_pp: -0.5\n546\t    ci_95:\n547\t    - -3.0\n548\t    - 1.5\n549\t    ci_includes_positive: true\n550\t    mcnemar_p: 0.75\n551\t    kappa_multitemp: 0.46\n552\t    eff_k_multitemp: 1.94\n553\t  result_rationale: 'Multi-temp 设计意图通过温度多样性增加 trace independence。但 trace 间 structural\n554\t    correlation 主要来自模型权重而非采样温度。κ=0.46 (vs single-temp T=0.7 κ=0.50) 仅微幅下降， Eff-K 从\n555\t    1.85 增到 1.94 — 微弱 independence 提升不足以克服混合温度的 constraint quality 下降 (低 T trace 更\n556\t    repetitive 且 extraction 更 noisy，高 T trace 更 random)。 CI [-3.0, +1.5] 包含正值，不能宣称\n557\t    definitively fails，只能说 \"consistent with null\"。\n558\t\n559\t    '\n560\t  tables:\n561\t  - Appendix remediation table\n562\t  figures_description: []\n563\t  analysis: 'Multi-temp 是第 9 种 remediation failure (最弱证据，CI 跨 0)。Paper 处理为： \"multi-temp\n564\t    did not significantly improve; any positive effect, if it exists, is small relative\n565\t    to the oracle gap (+14pp).\"\n566\t\n567\t    '\n568\t- name: mistral_folio204_t03\n569\t  plan_id: exp-057\n570\t  description: Mistral-7B FOLIO 204 at T=0.3\n571\t  expected_results:\n572\t    n: 204\n573\t    sc_accuracy_pct: 53.9\n574\t    sica_accuracy_pct: 55.4\n575\t    delta_pp: 1.5\n576\t    mcnemar_p: 0.42\n577\t    ci_95:\n578\t    - -2.0\n579\t    - 5.0\n580\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.65\n581\t    kappa_estimated: 0.55\n582\t    eff_k_estimated: 1.73\n583\t    extraction_rate: 0.96\n584\t  result_rationale: 'T=0.3 使 trace 更 deterministic，κ↑至 0.55 (vs T=0.7 的 0.50)，Eff-K↓至\n585\t    1.73。 理论上应更差。但 median tier 预测意外正值 +1.5pp：低温 trace 虽更 correlated 但也更 confident，约束表达更一致\n586\t    (fewer extraction errors)。Quality↑ 部分抵消 independence↓。 +1.5pp 属 stochastic noise\n587\t    (CI [-2, 5] 跨 0)。 这是 T sensitivity curve 的关键 complication：T=0.3 意外正值打破 monotonicity。\n588\t\n589\t    '\n590\t  tables:\n591\t  - Appendix T sensitivity table\n592\t  figures_description:\n593\t  - 'Appendix: T vs Δpp 折线图，T=0.3 标注 CI overlay'\n594\t  analysis: 'T=0.3 +1.5pp 是 narrative complication。理论预测低 T → 差效果，但实际微正。 CI 跨 0 所以与\n595\t    null 一致。Frame: \"temperature effect directionally consistent (peak at T=0.7) despite\n596\t    noise at T=0.3.\"\n597\t\n598\t    '\n599\t- name: mistral_folio204_t05\n600\t  plan_id: exp-058\n601\t  description: Mistral-7B FOLIO 204 at T=0.5\n602\t  expected_results:\n603\t    n: 204\n604\t    sc_accuracy_pct: 54.4\n605\t    sica_accuracy_pct: 57.2\n606\t    delta_pp: 2.8\n607\t    mcnemar_p: 0.15\n608\t    ci_95:\n609\t    - -0.5\n610\t    - 6.0\n611\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.75\n612\t    kappa_estimated: 0.48\n613\t    eff_k_estimated: 1.81\n614\t    extraction_rate: 0.97\n615\t  result_rationale: 'T=0.5 是 T=0.3 和 T=0.7 的插值。κ=0.48 介于两者之间，Eff-K=1.81。 Delta +2.8pp\n616\t    正向但 p=0.15 不显著。完整 T curve: T=0.3(+1.5) → T=0.5(+2.8) → T=0.7(+4.9) → T=1.0(+0.5)。大致\n617\t    peak-at-0.7 但 T=0.3 意外正值使 curve 不完全 monotonic。 T=0.5 的 trace 比 T=0.3 更 diverse\n618\t    但比 T=0.7 更 consistent，quality-independence trade-off 使效果介于两者之间。\n619\t\n620\t    '\n621\t  tables:\n622\t  - Appendix T sensitivity table\n623\t  figures_description:\n624\t  - 'Appendix: T vs Δpp with full curve T=0.3/0.5/0.7/1.0 and CI bands'\n625\t  analysis: '完整 T curve 支持 \"T=0.7 peak\" 但不完全 monotonic。Paper frame: \"SICA gains are\n626\t    concentrated in narrow T range around 0.5-0.7; extreme fragility to hyperparameter\n627\t    choice is itself evidence of the independence bottleneck.\"\n628\t\n629\t    '\n630\t- name: 14b_pw600_16639\n631\t  plan_id: exp-039\n632\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B PW-D5-600 with max_tokens=16639 (longer context rerun)\n633\t  expected_results:\n634\t    n: 600\n635\t    sica_accuracy_pct: 75.8\n636\t    sc_accuracy_pct: 75.2\n637\t    delta_pp: 0.6\n638\t    mcnemar_p: 0.65\n639\t    extraction_rate: 0.97\n640\t    contradiction_rate: 0.018\n641\t    kappa_estimated: 0.75\n642\t    eff_k_estimated: 1.3\n643\t  result_rationale: '16639 token context 解决早期 truncation 问题，extraction rate 89%→97%。\n644\t    但 Qwen-14B κ≈0.75 Eff-K≈1.30 不变。Delta +0.6pp (比 sica_expanded_14b 的 +0.3pp 略好)\n645\t    因为 better extraction 减少 noise constraints，但 independence bottleneck 仍限制。 n=600\n646\t    给出更 precise estimate：SICA 在 Qwen PW 上 true effect ~0.5pp 但远不显著。\n647\t\n648\t    '\n649\t  tables:\n650\t  - T1\n651\t  figures_description: []\n652\t  analysis: 'Extraction improvement (89→97%) 仅转化 ~0.3pp 额外增益。 证明 extraction quality\n653\t    有微弱贡献但远不足以克服 independence bottleneck。\n654\t\n655\t    '\n656\t- name: qwen3_pw600_16639\n657\t  plan_id: exp-040\n658\t  description: Qwen3-14B PW-D5-600 with max_tokens=16639\n659\t  expected_results:\n660\t    n: 600\n661\t    sica_accuracy_pct: 76.2\n662\t    sc_accuracy_pct: 75.8\n663\t    delta_pp: 0.4\n664\t    mcnemar_p: 0.72\n665\t    extraction_rate: 0.99\n666\t    contradiction_rate: 0.025\n667\t    kappa_estimated: 0.72\n668\t    eff_k_estimated: 1.35\n669\t  result_rationale: 'Qwen3 extraction 更好 (99%) 且约束更多 (exp-027 显示 unique 7031)。 但 κ\n670\t    仅微降 (0.72 vs Qwen2.5 0.75)，Eff-K 微升 (1.35 vs 1.30)。 Qwen 家族 generation pattern\n671\t    跨代相对稳定。Delta +0.4pp 在 noise range 内。 更好 extraction 被更高 contradiction rate (2.5%)\n672\t    部分抵消。\n673\t\n674\t    '\n675\t  tables:\n676\t  - T1\n677\t  figures_description: []\n678\t  analysis: 'Qwen3 vs Qwen2.5 generational scaling 不改变 fundamental picture。 支持 \"generational\n679\t    scaling does not resolve independence bottleneck\" (remediation failure 之一)。\n680\t\n681\t    '\n682\t- name: llama8b_pw600\n683\t  plan_id: exp-048\n684\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B PW-D5-600\n685\t  expected_results:\n686\t    n: 600\n687\t    sica_accuracy_pct: 62.2\n688\t    sc_accuracy_pct: 60.8\n689\t    delta_pp: 1.4\n690\t    mcnemar_p: 0.32\n691\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.55\n692\t    extraction_rate: 0.85\n693\t    kappa_estimated: 0.4\n694\t    eff_k_estimated: 2.22\n695\t  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B PW600 SC~61% (Goldilocks zone)，C0=55%。κ≈0.40, Eff-K≈2.22\n696\t    — 比 Qwen 更 independent 但低于 Mistral PW (κ=0.21, Eff-K=3.63)。Delta +1.4pp 正向但 n.s.\n697\t    n=600 给出比 D012 (n=60) 更 tight 的 CI，确认 LLaMA PW 有微弱正向趋势但不 significant。 与 exp-046\n698\t    (Mistral PW600 delta=-2.83pp, SC=39%) 对比验证 dual bottleneck： LLaMA 满足 SC>50% →\n699\t    delta 正向；Mistral 不满足 → delta 负向。\n700\t\n701\t    '\n702\t  tables:\n703\t  - T1\n704\t  figures_description:\n705\t  - 'F2 scatter: LLaMA-8B PW600 (SC≈61%, Δ=+1.4) vs Mistral PW600 (SC≈39%, Δ=-2.8)'\n706\t  analysis: LLaMA vs Mistral PW600 对比是 dual bottleneck (independence + quality) 的直接证据。\n707\t    两者 Eff-K 都较高 (2.22 vs 3.63) 但 SC 差异导致完全不同结果。 支持 \"sufficient Eff-K AND sufficient\n708\t    SC\" 的联合条件。\n709\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ab0a913-2026-4f2a-a2ff-d07223574bf7","uuid":"9c7a2209-73ec-4bb3-a44e-3fd994aee307","timestamp":"2026-05-19T04:40:59.256Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260519T034058/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Dual Bottleneck 框架方向正确但 Eff-K 作为定量预测器有噪声，需弱化为 \"necessary condition\n  that interacts with SC\"。 K/T sensitivity curves 呈大致 inverted-U / peak-at-0.7 但各有\n  1-2 个 non-monotonic outlier， 用 error bar / CI overlay 展示 noise level，frame 为 \"directionally\n  consistent despite noise\"。 论文重心从 Condorcet 理论预测力转向 oracle gap (+14.22pp, p=2e-7)\n  + 9 remediation failures (breadth argument)。 Condorcet 框架降为 \"explanatory lens\" 而非\n  \"predictive framework\"。 Seed variance 明确表述为 \"Eff-K explains cross-model variance;\n  within-model variance remains dominated by stochastic factors\"。 exp-050b ICL complication\n  放 discussion 作为 limitation / future work。 投稿目标 Findings (≥3.0)；如 breadth of analysis\n  获审稿人认可可能升 Main (≤3.2)。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B K sensitivity (K=6,8,11,12,16,20) on D012 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    K6_sica: 0.733\n    K6_sc: 0.733\n    K6_delta_pp: 0.0\n    K8_sica: 0.717\n    K8_sc: 0.75\n    K8_delta_pp: -3.3\n    K11_sica: 0.733\n    K11_sc: 0.733\n    K11_delta_pp: 0.0\n    K12_sica: 0.717\n    K12_sc: 0.75\n    K12_delta_pp: -3.3\n    K16_sica: 0.7\n    K16_sc: 0.733\n    K16_delta_pp: -3.3\n    K20_sica: 0.7\n    K20_sc: 0.717\n    K20_delta_pp: -1.7\n    all_K_sica_leq_sc: true\n    kappa_14b_estimated: 0.76\n    eff_k_range: 1.25–1.32\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B Fleiss'' κ≈0.76，Eff-K 仅 1.25–1.32，trace 间几乎完全相关。 增加\n    K 只叠加冗余 trace 而不增加独立信息。Qwen SC 基线 ~75% 处于 Type A regime (confirmation bias)，约束方向镜像模型偏差。因此所有\n    K 值 SICA ≤ SC。 K=11 (odd) 消除 exact-tie 场景，gap=0 确认 Qwen 上 SICA 无 tiebreak 之外的获益机制。\n    Larger K 时 SICA 略劣，因更多约束放大了 confirmation bias。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T5\n  figures_description:\n  - F3 中 Qwen 对照线 (flat/declining)，与 Mistral inverted-U 形成对比\n  analysis: 'Qwen 全 K 值 SICA≤SC 是 Eff-K 理论的 negative control。K=11 gap=0 额外确认 SICA\n    对 Qwen 无非 tiebreak 价值。与 exp-051 (Mistral inverted-U) 对比是 T5 的核心叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: SICA vs SC-random/deterministic tiebreak，CPU-only 重分析\n  expected_results:\n    n_tiebreak_cases: 5\n    sica_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.8\n    random_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.5\n    alphabetical_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.6\n    first_seen_tiebreak_win_rate: 0.4\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B D012 中仅 ~5 个 tied cases (C0=53% 但多数 multi-candidate\n    问题 SC 有明确多数)。 SICA 4/5 选对 (80%) 优于 random (50%)，但 n 太小无统计显著性。 说明 SICA tiebreak\n    机制本身有效，但 Qwen 上 tied 场景太少，整体增益被稀释到 ~0pp。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 footnote\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Tiebreak 是 SICA 唯一有效的子机制。Qwen 高 κ 条件下约束无法在 non-tied cases 中翻转 SC， 限制了总体影响。回应\n    reviewer concern #13 (random tiebreak baseline)。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_7b_scaling\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60 questions (K=12, T=0.7)\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n    sc_accuracy: 0.683\n    delta_pp: 0.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.433\n    extraction_rate: 0.942\n    mcnemar_p: 1.0\n    kappa_estimated: 0.68\n    eff_k_estimated: 1.42\n    folio_sica: 0.767\n    folio_sc: 0.733\n    proofwriter_sica: 0.6\n    proofwriter_sc: 0.633\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-7B 比 14B 弱但同家族，κ 仍高 (~0.68)，Eff-K~1.42。C0 比 14B 高 (43% vs\n    38%) 但 constraint quality 同样受 Qwen 系 confirmation bias 影响。SC 基线 ~68% 处于 Type A\n    边缘。Delta=0 因为 FOLIO 微正 (+3.3pp) 被 PW 微负 (-3.3pp) 抵消。 Qwen 家族内 scaling 不改变 SICA\n    效果方向。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  - T3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter: Qwen-7B (SC≈68%, Δ=0)'\n  analysis: 'Qwen-7B 进一步确认 Qwen 家族的 independence bottleneck。即使 SC 降到 68% (更接近 Goldilocks)，trace\n    κ 仍高到 SICA 无法获益。支持 \"Eff-K 是跨模型必要条件\"。\n\n    '\n- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: QwQ-32B 已有数据汇总为 negative control\n  expected_results:\n    total_problems: 46\n    qwq_aggregate_c0_effective_pct: 2.6\n    aime_c0: 0.0\n    proofwriter_c0: 18.75\n    folio_c0: 0.0\n    aime_delta_pp: 0.0\n    proofwriter_delta_pp: -5.9\n    kappa_estimated: 0.92\n    eff_k_estimated: 1.08\n  result_rationale: 'QwQ-32B 作为 reasoning model，内置 CoT 极度 deterministic。即使 T=0.7，reasoning\n    chain 使 trace 间 κ→0.92，Eff-K→1.08 (几乎退化为单次采样)。C0 有效率仅 2.6%，SICA≡SC。 这是 Eff-K 框架最极端的验证：Eff-K≈1\n    时任何聚合方法都无法超越 single sample。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  - T3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter 最右上角: QwQ-32B (SC high, Δ=0)'\n  analysis: 'QwQ-32B 是 degenerate case。完美回应 reviewer concern #12 \"为什么不用 reasoning\n    model\"。 Reasoning model trace 更 deterministic → C0→0 → SICA 退化。放 Appendix 详述。\n\n    '\n- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: C0 vs SICA-SC gap 跨所有 model×dataset 条件的 scatter 分析\n  expected_results:\n    n_conditions: 12\n    c0_delta_pearson_r: 0.45\n    c0_delta_pearson_p: 0.14\n    c0_below_20_conditions: 4\n    c0_below_20_all_delta_leq_0: true\n    c0_above_20_positive_delta_rate: 0.5\n    outlier_conditions: 2\n    c0_necessary_not_sufficient: true\n  result_rationale: 'C0<20% 的 4 个条件 (QwQ-32B, ARC-14B, GSM8K-14B, Qwen-72B) 全部 delta≤0，\n    C0 作为必要条件方向正确。但 C0>20% 不保证正 delta：LLaMA FOLIO-204 C0=62% delta=-2.5pp， Mistral\n    PW600 C0=50% delta=-2.8pp。r=0.45 方向正确但 p=0.14 不显著 (12 个点太少)。 C0 只捕捉 diversity\n    维度，不反映 constraint quality，因此不够做 \"predictor\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 summary\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 hero figure: C0 (x) vs Δpp (y) scatter，C0=20% 虚线 threshold'\n  analysis: 'C0 零成本部署诊断的价值在于 negative predictive power：C0<20% → 不要部署 SICA。 Positive\n    prediction 需结合 SC level 和 Eff-K。这是 median tier \"necessary condition\" 叙事的定量支撑，也是\n    Claim 4 (C0+SC diagnostic) 的核心证据。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_72b_awq\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on D012 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    sica_accuracy: 0.833\n    sc_accuracy: 0.85\n    delta_pp: -1.7\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.15\n    extraction_rate: 0.95\n    kappa_estimated: 0.82\n    eff_k_estimated: 1.2\n    mcnemar_p: 1.0\n  result_rationale: '72B 是 Qwen 家族最强模型，SC 基线 ~85%，C0 仅 15%。κ≈0.82，Eff-K≈1.20。 完全处于\n    Type A regime：trace 高度一致 → 约束全部 confirm 多数答案 → SICA=SC 或略劣。 delta=-1.7pp 因为个别\n    case 中 SICA 约束排除了原本正确的少数答案。 形成 Qwen 内 7B/14B/72B scaling curve：越强 → C0 越低 → SICA\n    越无效到有害。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter: Qwen-72B (SC≈85%, Δ≈-1.7)'\n  analysis: '72B 完善 Qwen 家族 scaling 分析：7B(SC=68%,Δ=0) → 14B(SC=75%,Δ=+0.3) → 72B(SC=85%,Δ=-1.7)。\n    Model size↑ → SC↑ C0↓ Eff-K↓。完美支持 Type A regime 理论。回应 reviewer concern #5 模型覆盖。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 5-10 道代表性问题的约束质量定性分析\n  expected_results:\n    n_cases: 8\n    trivially_satisfied_pct: 43\n    semantically_meaningful_pct: 35\n    confirmation_bias_aligned_pct: 55\n    extraction_error_pct: 12\n    cases_constraint_flips_correct: 2\n    cases_constraint_flips_wrong: 1\n  result_rationale: '定性分析揭示三种典型约束模式：(1) 43% trivially satisfied — 被所有候选答案满足； (2) 35%\n    semantically meaningful 但方向与模型多数答案一致 (confirmation bias)； (3) 12% 提取错误 (语法错误、变量名不一致)。净效果：~92%\n    约束 ARE discriminative (exp-023) 但 discrimination 方向与模型偏差对齐。2/8 cases 翻转正确，1/8\n    翻转错误。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4 stacked bar: constraint quality breakdown by category'\n  analysis: 'Case studies 为 T4 taxonomy 提供具体例子。关键 insight：问题不在约束缺乏判别力， 而在 discriminative\n    约束的区分方向与模型偏差一致。是 confirmation bias 的 mechanism-level 证据。\n\n    '\n- name: overhead_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: SICA pipeline wall-time 分解 (n=804)\n  expected_results:\n    n: 804\n    mean_total_wall_s: 61.6\n    trace_gen_pct: 51.3\n    extract_pct: 47.0\n    dedup_pct: 1.6\n    maxsat_pct: 0.005\n    sica_overhead_pct: 48.7\n    p90_overhead_pct: 57.6\n  result_rationale: 'SICA 额外开销几乎全部来自 constraint extraction (LLM 二次调用 ~47%)，MaxSAT\n    求解极快 (<0.01%)。 总成本约 SC 的 2 倍。在 median tier 下 SICA 增益 ≤+5pp 且仅在特定条件下有效， 但成本翻倍。Paper\n    应 frame 为 analysis tool 而非 practical improvement。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - Appendix overhead table\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '48.7% overhead 全来自 extraction。如果 extraction 可做更好 (oracle gap +14pp 显示上限)，\n    overhead 合理。但当前 self-extraction 质量使 overhead 不值。支持 pure analysis framing。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions (K=12, T=0.7)\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    sica_accuracy: 0.667\n    sc_accuracy: 0.6\n    delta_pp: 6.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.617\n    extraction_rate: 0.856\n    mcnemar_p: 0.219\n    kappa_estimated: 0.38\n    eff_k_estimated: 2.35\n    folio_delta_pp: 10.0\n    proofwriter_delta_pp: 3.33\n    truncated_traces: 44\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B SC 基线 ~60%，C0 高达 62%，处于 Goldilocks zone 边缘。κ≈0.38，Eff-K≈2.35，\n    trace 间独立性明显高于 Qwen。+6.67pp 是 D012 上最大 raw delta，但 n=60 致 p=0.22 不显著。 FOLIO 子集\n    +10pp 突出。但 exp-020 (LLaMA FOLIO-204 delta=-2.45pp) 警告这可能是 small-n artifact。 在\n    median tier 中是 \"suggestive but unreplicated\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  - T3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter: LLaMA-8B D012 (SC≈60%, Δ=+6.7, n.s.) 高亮但标注 n=60'\n  analysis: 'LLaMA-8B 支持 \"moderate Eff-K can enable gains\" 但 exp-020 的反转 (-2.45pp)\n    限制了 claim 强度。 在 paper 中作为 directional evidence，不能做 confirmation。\n\n    '\n- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot (K=12)\n  expected_results:\n    n: 30\n    sica_accuracy: 0.967\n    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n    delta_pp: 0.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.133\n    extraction_success_rate: 0.147\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B GSM8K SC~97%，几乎全对。C0 仅 13%。更关键的是 extraction rate 仅 15%\n    — 数学域 constraint extraction 困难得多 (开放答案空间，数值计算而非逻辑推理)。 GSM8K 是 Type A 极端 + Type\n    B 部分：SC 太高 AND domain formalization 困难。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter: GSM8K (SC≈97%, Δ=0)'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K 贡献两个 insight：(1) 数学域 extraction 本身困难，C0 不适用； (2) 简单 math 上 SC 太高无论如何\n    SICA 无效。支持 Type B (domain formalizability)。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight 消融 (n=804)\n  expected_results:\n    maxsat_accuracy: 0.765\n    count_only_accuracy: 0.766\n    random_weight_accuracy: 0.759\n    sc_baseline: 0.762\n    agreement_maxsat_vs_countonly: 803/804\n    mcnemar_all_nonsignificant: true\n  result_rationale: 'MaxSAT 与 count-only agreement 达 803/804 (99.9%)。MaxSAT 的 satisfiability\n    weighting 在当前约束质量下无额外贡献 — 简单计数就能达到相同效果。根因：约束间高度冗余 (同 trace 提取 的约束倾向同方向)，MaxSAT\n    组合优化退化为简单计数。是 independence bottleneck 的 mechanism-level 证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 footnote / Appendix\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'MaxSAT=count-only 是 capability trap 核心机制证据。若约束独立，MaxSAT 应发现组合 patterns。\n    约束高冗余使求解器退化。对比 exp-031 oracle (+14pp) 证明 solver 本身没问题，是输入约束质量限制。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B on D012 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n    sc_accuracy: 0.717\n    delta_pp: -3.33\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.583\n    extraction_rate: 0.839\n    truncated_traces: 72\n    mcnemar_p: 0.48\n    kappa_estimated: 0.52\n    eff_k_estimated: 1.78\n  result_rationale: 'DeepSeek-R1 蒸馏版 trace 带 extended thinking，C0=58% (vs QwQ 2.6%)\n    但 72/720 traces 被 truncated (max_tokens 限制)。Truncation 破坏 constraint extraction\n    质量导致 delta=-3.33pp。 Eff-K 理论预测方向正确 (moderate Eff-K≈1.78 应有正向潜力) 但 truncation confound\n    使预测失效。 这是 median tier \"noise point\" 之一。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  - T3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter: DeepSeek-R1 标注 ''truncation confound'''\n  analysis: 'DeepSeek-R1 的 negative delta 由 truncation artifact 驱动，非 independence\n    bottleneck 反例。 Paper 中作为 caveat 处理。占 Eff-K 预测失败的 12 条件中的 1 个。\n\n    '\n- name: logic_lm_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-015\n  description: Logic-LM × K + majority vote baseline on FOLIO\n  expected_results:\n    n: 204\n    logic_lm_k12_accuracy: 0.74\n    sc_k12_accuracy: 0.755\n    sica_k12_accuracy: 0.745\n    logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp: -1.5\n    logic_lm_single_trace_accuracy: 0.72\n    fol_parse_rate: 0.82\n  result_rationale: 'Logic-LM 对每条 trace 独立做 FOL extraction + Z3 verification 然后 majority\n    vote。 在 Qwen-14B 高 κ 条件下，Logic-LM ≈ SC 因为每条 trace 的 FOL verification 大多验证了 trace\n    自身的答案 (self-consistency within trace)。FOL parse rate ~82% 限制了有效 trace 数量。 Logic-LM\n    略劣于 SC 因为 parse failure 的 trace 被丢弃降低了 vote pool。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - Appendix baseline comparison\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Logic-LM 证明 FOL extraction 本身不是 SICA 的 value add —— 差异在于跨 trace aggregation\n    (MaxSAT)。 但 MaxSAT=count-only (exp-013)，所以 SICA 唯一贡献是 tiebreak。加强 capability trap\n    论证。\n\n    '\n- name: weighted_sc_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-016\n  description: Weighted SC baseline (uniform/length/inv-length/constraint-count) on\n    804 questions\n  expected_results:\n    sc_uniform: 0.762\n    inv_length_weighted: 0.767\n    length_weighted: 0.753\n    constraint_count_weighted: 0.753\n    sica: 0.765\n    inv_length_vs_sc_p: 0.453\n    all_nonsignificant: true\n  result_rationale: '所有 weighting scheme 与 SC 无显著差异。Inv-length (+0.5pp) 略正 — 更短 trace\n    更可能是 confident 回答。但效果太小属随机波动。关键 takeaway：simple weighting 无法替代 independence —\n    问题不在 vote quality 而在 vote independence。Correlated votes 怎么 weight 仍然 correlated。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - Appendix baseline comparison\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '回应 reviewer concern #15。所有 weighting 全 n.s.，证明 independence bottleneck\n    是根本性的， 不能通过 simpler weighting 解决。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_strategyqa_14b\n  plan_id: exp-017\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60 questions (K=12)\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    sica_accuracy: 0.567\n    sc_accuracy: 0.533\n    delta_pp: 3.33\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n    extraction_rate_trace: 0.704\n    bootstrap_p: 0.135\n    contradiction_detected: 5\n    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n    discordant_sc_wins: 0\n  result_rationale: 'StrategyQA binary (Yes/No)，Qwen-14B SC~53% (接近随机)。C0 仅 10% 因为\n    binary format 只有 2 个候选，SC 容易 unanimous。Extraction rate 仅 70% (commonsense 难形式化为\n    FOL)。 +3.33pp 正向但 n.s. (仅 2 个 discordant cases)。Type B partial case：domain 部分可形式化\n    但约束质量低且 C0 低。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter: StrategyQA (SC≈53%, Δ=+3.3, n.s.)'\n  analysis: 'StrategyQA 低 C0 (10%) 说明 binary format 限制了 SICA 应用空间。即使 SC 在 Goldilocks\n    zone， answer space 太小导致 SC 容易 unanimous。支持 \"C0+SC two-dimensional diagnostic\"。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_arc_challenge_14b\n  plan_id: exp-018\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60 questions (K=12)\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    sica_accuracy: 0.95\n    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n    delta_pp: -1.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.05\n    extraction_rate: 1.0\n    contradiction_detected: 3\n    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen-14B ARC-Challenge SC=96.7%，极高基线。C0 仅 5% — 虽是 4-choice format\n    (理论上 C0 应更高) 但 14B 太强，高度确信一个选项。delta=-1.67pp 因仅有的 3 个 multi-candidate 问题中 SICA\n    1 个选错。 Type A extreme：模型太强 → C0→0 → SICA 退化。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter: ARC (SC≈97%, Δ=-1.7)'\n  analysis: 'ARC 的 4-choice format 理论上给 SICA 更多空间，但实际 C0 极低。 说明 C0 主要由模型能力决定而非答案格式。Type\n    A 极端案例。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_correlation\n  plan_id: exp-019\n  description: Constraint precision × C0 × SICA-SC gap 跨域跨模型相关分析\n  expected_results:\n    n_conditions: 12\n    constraint_precision_mean: 0.62\n    constraint_precision_range:\n    - 0.45\n    - 0.82\n    c0_quality_correlation_r: -0.35\n    c0_quality_correlation_p: 0.26\n    quality_delta_correlation_r: 0.28\n    quality_delta_correlation_p: 0.38\n    effk_sc_joint_prediction_correct: 8\n    effk_sc_joint_prediction_total: 12\n    false_positive_conditions:\n    - LLaMA-8B D012 (Eff-K=2.35, SC=60% → predicted positive, actual n.s.)\n    - StrategyQA-14B (SC=53% in zone but C0=10% → no room)\n    false_negative_conditions:\n    - DeepSeek-R1 (truncation confound)\n    - exp-050b ICL (trace generation characteristic change)\n  result_rationale: '高 SC 条件 (Qwen-14B/72B): quality~0.75-0.82, C0 低 → delta=0。 中\n    SC 条件 (Mistral FOLIO): quality~0.60-0.65, C0 中等 → delta variable。 低 SC 条件 (Mistral\n    PW600): quality~0.45-0.50, C0 高 → delta negative。 C0-quality 反相关 r=-0.35 方向正确但\n    p=0.26 (12 点太少+seed variance)。 Eff-K+SC 联合预测 8/12 方向正确：2 false positive (LLaMA\n    D012, StrategyQA)， 2 edge case (DeepSeek truncation, exp-050b ICL)。8/12 支持 \"necessary\n    condition\" 但不够强做 \"predictor\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T3 extended\n  - T4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 hero: SC vs Δ scatter with Eff-K color coding and constraint quality annotations'\n  analysis: '8/12 方向正确是 median tier 最关键的 qualification。Paper 核心表述： \"Eff-K explains\n    cross-model variance; within-model variance remains dominated by stochastic factors.\"\n    F2 用 Eff-K color coding 展示跨模型 pattern + error bar 展示 within-seed noise。\n\n    '\n- name: mistral_k_sensitivity\n  plan_id: exp-051\n  description: Mistral-7B K sensitivity (K=4,8,12,16,20) on FOLIO 204, seed=42\n  expected_results:\n    n: 204\n    K4_sc_pct: 55.4\n    K4_sica_pct: 54.9\n    K4_delta_pp: -0.5\n    K4_eff_k: 1.6\n    K4_mcnemar_p: 0.85\n    K8_sc_pct: 54.9\n    K8_sica_pct: 59.3\n    K8_delta_pp: 4.4\n    K8_eff_k: 1.78\n    K8_mcnemar_p: 0.03\n    K12_sc_pct: 54.4\n    K12_sica_pct: 58.3\n    K12_delta_pp: 3.9\n    K12_eff_k: 1.85\n    K12_mcnemar_p: 0.022\n    K16_sc_pct: 54.4\n    K16_sica_pct: 55.9\n    K16_delta_pp: 1.5\n    K16_eff_k: 1.88\n    K16_mcnemar_p: 0.38\n    K20_sc_pct: 53.9\n    K20_sica_pct: 55.9\n    K20_delta_pp: 2.0\n    K20_eff_k: 1.9\n    K20_mcnemar_p: 0.3\n    peak_K: 8\n    non_monotonic_points:\n    - K=8 高于 K=12\n    - K=20 略高于 K=16\n    inverted_u_visual: 大致 inverted-U 但 K=8 是实际最高点 (+4.4pp)，K=20 相对 K=16 有微弱反弹\n  result_rationale: \"Mistral FOLIO seed42 是唯一有正向 SICA 效果的核心条件。K sensitivity 预期大致 inverted-U：\\\n    \\ — K=4 (Eff-K=1.60): trace 太少，约束不足以可靠 discriminate，delta≈0。 — K=8 (Eff-K=1.78):\\\n    \\ 甜区 — 足够多约束但冗余尚低。约束间 overlap 比 K=12 更低，\\n  产生 non-monotonic 高点 +4.4pp。这是核心 outlier。\\n\\\n    — K=12 (Eff-K=1.85): delta=+3.9pp，与 exp-033 的 +4.9pp 接近但略低 (K ablation 用\\n  K=20\\\n    \\ traces 的 subset，与 exp-033 独立生成的 K=12 traces 有差异)。\\n— K=16 (Eff-K=1.88): 冗余约束增加，confirmation\\\n    \\ bias dominate，delta 下降到 +1.5pp。 — K=20 (Eff-K=1.90): 微弱反弹 +2.0pp — 第二个 non-monotonic\\\n    \\ 点。可能因 K=20 采样到\\n  更多 minority traces 偶然包含有用 diverse constraint。\\nK=8 > K=12\\\n    \\ 是 median tier 的核心 outlier。Paper 应用 CI overlay + error bar 处理。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - T5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F3 主图: K vs Δpp 折线 (Mistral inverted-U with CI bands + Qwen flat 对照)，K vs Eff-K\n    次轴'\n  analysis: 'K sensitivity inverted-U 部分验证 Eff-K 框架：K↑ → Eff-K↑ (diminishing returns)\n    → delta 先升后降。 但 K=8 > K=12 的 non-monotonicity 说明 Eff-K 不是唯一因素。 Paper frame: \"directionally\n    consistent despite noise; peak at K=8-12 supports moderate K recommendation.\"\n    与 Qwen flat line 对比是 T5/F3 核心叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: multitemp_mistral_folio\n  plan_id: exp-055\n  description: Multi-temperature ensemble (T=0.3/0.5/0.7/1.0 × 3 traces each = K=12)\n    Mistral FOLIO 204\n  expected_results:\n    n: 204\n    sc_accuracy_pct: 54.4\n    sica_multitemp_pct: 53.9\n    delta_pp: -0.5\n    ci_95:\n    - -3.0\n    - 1.5\n    ci_includes_positive: true\n    mcnemar_p: 0.75\n    kappa_multitemp: 0.46\n    eff_k_multitemp: 1.94\n  result_rationale: 'Multi-temp 设计意图通过温度多样性增加 trace independence。但 trace 间 structural\n    correlation 主要来自模型权重而非采样温度。κ=0.46 (vs single-temp T=0.7 κ=0.50) 仅微幅下降， Eff-K 从\n    1.85 增到 1.94 — 微弱 independence 提升不足以克服混合温度的 constraint quality 下降 (低 T trace 更\n    repetitive 且 extraction 更 noisy，高 T trace 更 random)。 CI [-3.0, +1.5] 包含正值，不能宣称\n    definitively fails，只能说 \"consistent with null\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - Appendix remediation table\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Multi-temp 是第 9 种 remediation failure (最弱证据，CI 跨 0)。Paper 处理为： \"multi-temp\n    did not significantly improve; any positive effect, if it exists, is small relative\n    to the oracle gap (+14pp).\"\n\n    '\n- name: mistral_folio204_t03\n  plan_id: exp-057\n  description: Mistral-7B FOLIO 204 at T=0.3\n  expected_results:\n    n: 204\n    sc_accuracy_pct: 53.9\n    sica_accuracy_pct: 55.4\n    delta_pp: 1.5\n    mcnemar_p: 0.42\n    ci_95:\n    - -2.0\n    - 5.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.65\n    kappa_estimated: 0.55\n    eff_k_estimated: 1.73\n    extraction_rate: 0.96\n  result_rationale: 'T=0.3 使 trace 更 deterministic，κ↑至 0.55 (vs T=0.7 的 0.50)，Eff-K↓至\n    1.73。 理论上应更差。但 median tier 预测意外正值 +1.5pp：低温 trace 虽更 correlated 但也更 confident，约束表达更一致\n    (fewer extraction errors)。Quality↑ 部分抵消 independence↓。 +1.5pp 属 stochastic noise\n    (CI [-2, 5] 跨 0)。 这是 T sensitivity curve 的关键 complication：T=0.3 意外正值打破 monotonicity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - Appendix T sensitivity table\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix: T vs Δpp 折线图，T=0.3 标注 CI overlay'\n  analysis: 'T=0.3 +1.5pp 是 narrative complication。理论预测低 T → 差效果，但实际微正。 CI 跨 0 所以与\n    null 一致。Frame: \"temperature effect directionally consistent (peak at T=0.7) despite\n    noise at T=0.3.\"\n\n    '\n- name: mistral_folio204_t05\n  plan_id: exp-058\n  description: Mistral-7B FOLIO 204 at T=0.5\n  expected_results:\n    n: 204\n    sc_accuracy_pct: 54.4\n    sica_accuracy_pct: 57.2\n    delta_pp: 2.8\n    mcnemar_p: 0.15\n    ci_95:\n    - -0.5\n    - 6.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.75\n    kappa_estimated: 0.48\n    eff_k_estimated: 1.81\n    extraction_rate: 0.97\n  result_rationale: 'T=0.5 是 T=0.3 和 T=0.7 的插值。κ=0.48 介于两者之间，Eff-K=1.81。 Delta +2.8pp\n    正向但 p=0.15 不显著。完整 T curve: T=0.3(+1.5) → T=0.5(+2.8) → T=0.7(+4.9) → T=1.0(+0.5)。大致\n    peak-at-0.7 但 T=0.3 意外正值使 curve 不完全 monotonic。 T=0.5 的 trace 比 T=0.3 更 diverse\n    但比 T=0.7 更 consistent，quality-independence trade-off 使效果介于两者之间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - Appendix T sensitivity table\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix: T vs Δpp with full curve T=0.3/0.5/0.7/1.0 and CI bands'\n  analysis: '完整 T curve 支持 \"T=0.7 peak\" 但不完全 monotonic。Paper frame: \"SICA gains are\n    concentrated in narrow T range around 0.5-0.7; extreme fragility to hyperparameter\n    choice is itself evidence of the independence bottleneck.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 14b_pw600_16639\n  plan_id: exp-039\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B PW-D5-600 with max_tokens=16639 (longer context rerun)\n  expected_results:\n    n: 600\n    sica_accuracy_pct: 75.8\n    sc_accuracy_pct: 75.2\n    delta_pp: 0.6\n    mcnemar_p: 0.65\n    extraction_rate: 0.97\n    contradiction_rate: 0.018\n    kappa_estimated: 0.75\n    eff_k_estimated: 1.3\n  result_rationale: '16639 token context 解决早期 truncation 问题，extraction rate 89%→97%。\n    但 Qwen-14B κ≈0.75 Eff-K≈1.30 不变。Delta +0.6pp (比 sica_expanded_14b 的 +0.3pp 略好)\n    因为 better extraction 减少 noise constraints，但 independence bottleneck 仍限制。 n=600\n    给出更 precise estimate：SICA 在 Qwen PW 上 true effect ~0.5pp 但远不显著。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Extraction improvement (89→97%) 仅转化 ~0.3pp 额外增益。 证明 extraction quality\n    有微弱贡献但远不足以克服 independence bottleneck。\n\n    '\n- name: qwen3_pw600_16639\n  plan_id: exp-040\n  description: Qwen3-14B PW-D5-600 with max_tokens=16639\n  expected_results:\n    n: 600\n    sica_accuracy_pct: 76.2\n    sc_accuracy_pct: 75.8\n    delta_pp: 0.4\n    mcnemar_p: 0.72\n    extraction_rate: 0.99\n    contradiction_rate: 0.025\n    kappa_estimated: 0.72\n    eff_k_estimated: 1.35\n  result_rationale: 'Qwen3 extraction 更好 (99%) 且约束更多 (exp-027 显示 unique 7031)。 但 κ\n    仅微降 (0.72 vs Qwen2.5 0.75)，Eff-K 微升 (1.35 vs 1.30)。 Qwen 家族 generation pattern\n    跨代相对稳定。Delta +0.4pp 在 noise range 内。 更好 extraction 被更高 contradiction rate (2.5%)\n    部分抵消。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Qwen3 vs Qwen2.5 generational scaling 不改变 fundamental picture。 支持 \"generational\n    scaling does not resolve independence bottleneck\" (remediation failure 之一)。\n\n    '\n- name: llama8b_pw600\n  plan_id: exp-048\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B PW-D5-600\n  expected_results:\n    n: 600\n    sica_accuracy_pct: 62.2\n    sc_accuracy_pct: 60.8\n    delta_pp: 1.4\n    mcnemar_p: 0.32\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.55\n    extraction_rate: 0.85\n    kappa_estimated: 0.4\n    eff_k_estimated: 2.22\n  result_rationale: 'LLaMA-8B PW600 SC~61% (Goldilocks zone)，C0=55%。κ≈0.40, Eff-K≈2.22\n    — 比 Qwen 更 independent 但低于 Mistral PW (κ=0.21, Eff-K=3.63)。Delta +1.4pp 正向但 n.s.\n    n=600 给出比 D012 (n=60) 更 tight 的 CI，确认 LLaMA PW 有微弱正向趋势但不 significant。 与 exp-046\n    (Mistral PW600 delta=-2.83pp, SC=39%) 对比验证 dual bottleneck： LLaMA 满足 SC>50% →\n    delta 正向；Mistral 不满足 → delta 负向。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 scatter: LLaMA-8B PW600 (SC≈61%, Δ=+1.4) vs Mistral PW600 (SC≈39%, Δ=-2.8)'\n  analysis: LLaMA vs Mistral PW600 对比是 dual bottleneck (independence + quality) 的直接证据。\n    两者 Eff-K 都较高 (2.22 vs 3.63) 但 SC 差异导致完全不同结果。 支持 \"sufficient Eff-K AND sufficient\n    SC\" 的联合条件。\n","numLines":709,"startLine":1,"totalLines":709}}}
