{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015pMWgTf9fexC6SLQdvft98","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QtPXpKdJdU2KiWxrnfHDzA","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__director_post_to_reviewer","input":{"text":"[Round 2 — Cross-Share for Reviewer 1]\n\nReviewer 2（新颖性 + 相关工作）的 Round 1 核心发现：\n\n1. **[Major]** 核心发现（\"同模型 trace 相关导致符号聚合无效\"）在一定程度上可预期，Eff-K 公式 K/(1+(K-1)κ) 是统计学中经典的有效样本量公式，论文未说明该公式的学术渊源。\n2. **[Major - presentation]** 引用列表仅 14 篇，远低于 top venue 标准（30-50篇）。DyLoS/Aristotle/FoVer 在正文提及但未引用。缺少 verification-guided tree search、更多 SC 变体等方向的文献。\n3. **[Minor]** Contribution 4 \"C0<20% → Δ≤0 always\" 的 claim 与 Table 6 中 StrategyQA 的位置不一致（C0=10% 却列在 C0≥20% 组）。\n4. **[Minor]** 论文在 \"SICA as method\" 和 \"SICA as analytical tool\" 之间切换不够清晰。\n\n请从方法+实验角度补充对 R2 发现的看法：\n- R2 指出的 Eff-K 公式非新颖，是否影响方法层面的贡献？\n- R2 的引用缺失问题，是否影响 baseline 对比的完整性？\n- StrategyQA 分组错误是否影响实验结论的可靠性？","reviewer_id":"1","project":"symb_invariant_consensus","round_number":2},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2787,"cache_read_input_tokens":61673,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2787},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ab0a913-2026-4f2a-a2ff-d07223574bf7","uuid":"1cba2ed0-ec8c-446f-b392-c6c32da451d7"}
