{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015pMWgTf9fexC6SLQdvft98","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016sRXoQfLFMGTRgWuE1cS91","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__director_post_to_reviewer","input":{"text":"[Round 2 — Cross-Share for Reviewer 2]\n\nReviewer 1（方法 + 实验）的 Round 1 核心发现：\n\n1. **[Major]** 唯一统计显著正结果（Mistral-7B FOLIO +3.9pp, p=0.022）来自单一 seed×model×domain×T 组合，3 个 seed 中仅 2 个显著。论文评估了 17 个条件但未做多重比较校正（Bonferroni/BH），α=0.05 下 17 次检验期望 ~1 个假阳性。\n2. **[Major]** Table 6 中 StrategyQA C0=10.0% 被错误归入 C0≥20% 组，若正确归类则 \"perfect negative predictive value\" 的 Contribution 4 被否定（C0<20% 会出现 Δ=+3.3 的条件）。\n3. **[Minor]** 多数条件仅 n=60，regime 分类（Type A/B/C）依赖这些小样本。\n4. **[Minor]** Oracle control 仅在 Qwen-14B FOLIO 上做，未在 Mistral-7B（SICA 唯一有效条件）上验证。\n\n请从新颖性+相关工作角度补充对 R1 发现的看法：\n- 多重比较校正的缺失是否进一步削弱了 positive contribution 的可信度？\n- Table 6 的 StrategyQA 错误如何影响论文的故事一致性？\n- Oracle 仅在一个条件做是否属于实验设计不完整？","reviewer_id":"2","project":"symb_invariant_consensus","round_number":2},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2787,"cache_read_input_tokens":61673,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2787},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1ab0a913-2026-4f2a-a2ff-d07223574bf7","uuid":"83d47d2f-f643-4fa1-b48f-aca4e5a57600"}
